WEBVTT

00:10:55.317 --> 00:11:00.197
(Applause)

00:11:00.197 --> 00:11:02.241
That was Bill.

00:11:03.158 --> 00:11:06.662
Our members taught us to play
bridge and mahjong.

00:11:06.704 --> 00:11:08.205
They taught us to paint.

00:11:08.247 --> 00:11:11.333
They taught us to repair our bicycles.

00:11:11.333 --> 00:11:14.712
We tutored and mentored local school kids.

00:11:14.753 --> 00:11:20.134
We set up English as a second language
programs for newcomers.

00:11:20.467 --> 00:11:24.054
We had book clubs, we had film clubs,

00:11:24.096 --> 00:11:26.348
we even had a few golf clubs.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.643
Exhausting, but exhilarating.